          "claim": "The first-stage fibers form σ(S_1); H(S_1)=Σ_{i∈S_1}T_i/π_i^(1) is measurable and integrable, and summing the product law on each fiber verifies its defining event integrals, so E[T̂|σ(S_1)]=H.",
          "inputs": [
            "A1",
            "F1",
