          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "The joint law is\n$$P_d\\bigl(S_1,(S_i)_{i\\in S_1}\\bigr)\n=p_1(S_1)\\prod_{i\\in S_1}p_{2i}(S_i).$$",
          "uses": [
